	(gr_text "Build Notes:\nDiodes, MCU, & Resistors all surface-mount to this side of the PCB (bottom).\nLEDs should be surface-mounted to the top side. Install LEDs before adding switches.\nMCU Footprint for the 0xCB Helios RP20240 MCU. NOT COMPATIBLE WITH ELITE C, LEDs also REQUIRE the use of a Helios. Other {dblquote}Community Edition{dblquote} RP2040 MCUs dont route GPIO11 which is used for the Top-LED "
